WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.567
But we begin

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:01.868
this morning with the breaking news

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:02.769
we are now learning.

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:03.770
It was not Russia

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:05.372
that fired a missile into Poland

00:00:05.372 --> 00:00:06.906
that killed two people overnight.

00:00:06.906 --> 00:00:07.941
Obviously, Russia

00:00:07.941 --> 00:00:09.542
Poland is a member of the military

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.244
alliance known as Naito.

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:13.079
But instead, initial U.S.

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.781
assessments are that it likely came

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:16.383
from Ukrainian forces.

00:00:16.383 --> 00:00:17.884
This development comes as NATO's

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:18.852
ambassadors are holding

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.487
an emergency meeting this morning

00:00:20.487 --> 00:00:22.389
to discuss the deadly explosion.

00:00:22.389 --> 00:00:23.923
Kevin Liptak is CNN's

00:00:23.923 --> 00:00:24.491
Kevin Love

00:00:24.491 --> 00:00:25.759
is live for CNN this morning

00:00:25.759 --> 00:00:26.760
in Bali, Indonesia,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.028
where the president just left

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.162
a few hours ago.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:30.130
Kevin, what's your reporting

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.031
this morning?

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:33.033
Yeah.

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:33.800
Two officials

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:36.503
who are familiar with an initial U.S.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:37.404
assessment

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.006
say this assessment says that the missile

00:00:40.006 --> 00:00:41.374
did not originate in Russia,

00:00:41.374 --> 00:00:43.743
but that it originated in Ukraine.

00:00:43.743 --> 00:00:46.112
And we do know that Ukraine uses Russian

00:00:46.112 --> 00:00:48.448
made missiles in its air defense system.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:49.616
And it does seem

00:00:49.616 --> 00:00:51.851
as if this is what President Biden

00:00:51.851 --> 00:00:52.585
was alluding to

00:00:52.585 --> 00:00:53.386
when he emerged

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.855
after crisis talks here at the G20

00:00:56.122 --> 00:00:56.623
and said

00:00:56.623 --> 00:00:57.624
that it was unlikely

00:00:57.624 --> 00:00:59.759
that this missile originated in Russia.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:01.161
Of course, he wanted to say that

00:01:01.161 --> 00:01:02.295
he wanted to be definitive

00:01:02.295 --> 00:01:03.063
he wants to look at

00:01:03.063 --> 00:01:04.931
all of the intelligence first

00:01:04.931 --> 00:01:06.966
before he can come out and say

00:01:06.966 --> 00:01:08.168
with any certainty where

00:01:08.168 --> 00:01:09.569
this missile originated.

00:01:09.569 --> 00:01:10.203
And I think that's

00:01:10.203 --> 00:01:11.671
because of the implications

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.672
that are at stake here.

00:01:12.672 --> 00:01:15.542
Poland, of course, is a member of Naito.

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:16.743
You have Article five,

00:01:16.743 --> 00:01:18.511
which is the Common Defense Treaty.

00:01:18.511 --> 00:01:19.712
An attack against one

00:01:19.712 --> 00:01:21.614
is an attack against all.

00:01:21.614 --> 00:01:23.283
And certainly President Biden

00:01:23.283 --> 00:01:24.384
and other Western leaders

00:01:24.384 --> 00:01:25.785
want to be absolutely sure

00:01:25.785 --> 00:01:26.352
that they know

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:28.288
where this missile originated

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:29.189
before they come out

00:01:29.189 --> 00:01:30.857
and say so definitively.

00:01:30.857 --> 00:01:32.425
Now, we do know that this assessment

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:34.461
was a topic of discussion

00:01:34.461 --> 00:01:35.428
among the leaders

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:36.696
when President Biden

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:39.365
convened them at his hotel here in Bali.

00:01:39.365 --> 00:01:40.900
Members of the G7,

00:01:40.900 --> 00:01:42.969
some members of NATO's states.

00:01:42.969 --> 00:01:44.170
We also understand

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.172
that it will be discussed in Brussels

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.007
today as Naito members

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:50.043
begin talking about a way forward,

00:01:50.043 --> 00:01:52.278
talking about this analysis Now, what

00:01:52.812 --> 00:01:54.948
National Security Council spokesman said

00:01:55.148 --> 00:01:55.849
is that the U.S.

00:01:55.849 --> 00:01:56.616
will support

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.418
Poland's ongoing investigation

00:01:58.418 --> 00:02:00.453
and this is still being investigated.

00:02:00.453 --> 00:02:01.354
They're sort of breaking out

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:02.655
the pieces of this missile,

00:02:02.655 --> 00:02:03.957
putting it back together,

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:06.392
trying to figure out where it came from.

00:02:06.392 --> 00:02:08.428
We also heard from an adviser

00:02:08.561 --> 00:02:09.295
to the Ukrainian

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:10.930
president, Volodymyr Zelensky,

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:12.398
who did not deny reports

00:02:12.398 --> 00:02:13.233
that this missile

00:02:13.233 --> 00:02:14.367
originated in Ukraine,

00:02:14.367 --> 00:02:15.702
but essentially said

00:02:15.702 --> 00:02:17.070
that any casualties in

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.672
this were our responsibility of Russia

00:02:20.006 --> 00:02:21.741
because it began this conflict.

00:02:22.809 --> 00:02:24.010
Great reporting, Kevin Love.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:24.811
Thank you.

00:02:24.844 --> 00:02:25.078
All right.

00:02:25.078 --> 00:02:25.912
Now, let's bring in our colleague

00:02:25.912 --> 00:02:26.513
Matthew Chance.

00:02:26.513 --> 00:02:27.747
He is live for CNN this morning

00:02:27.747 --> 00:02:29.516
in the Polish village of shaved off

00:02:29.516 --> 00:02:30.450
for the blast happened.

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.751
Matthew I wonder this morning.

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.720
Have you heard from Polish officials

00:02:33.720 --> 00:02:35.221
since we have learned that news

00:02:35.221 --> 00:02:36.489
that this missile likely

00:02:36.489 --> 00:02:38.958
originated in Ukraine

00:02:41.127 --> 00:02:42.195
Not not this morning.

00:02:42.195 --> 00:02:42.829
So far, though,

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:44.330
we are expecting a statement

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.331
over the next few minutes

00:02:45.331 --> 00:02:46.366
after the

00:02:46.366 --> 00:02:47.367
president and the prime

00:02:47.367 --> 00:02:49.769
minister of the country formulate

00:02:49.769 --> 00:02:51.104
what their latest position is.

00:02:51.104 --> 00:02:52.872
Of course, there's been high level

00:02:52.872 --> 00:02:54.440
meetings taking place in the country.

00:02:54.440 --> 00:02:55.542
You can see behind me

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:57.710
is a Polish military vehicles

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.547
heading to the same of the explosion

00:03:00.547 --> 00:03:01.581
of that missile

00:03:01.581 --> 00:03:02.549
where those two people

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:03.383
were killed, Polish.

00:03:03.383 --> 00:03:05.385
This is, of course, on Polish territory

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.820
because there's an ongoing investigation

00:03:07.820 --> 00:03:09.355
underway on the ground

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.324
which is likely to include

00:03:11.324 --> 00:03:13.126
experts from the United States as well,

00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.027
although it's not clear

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:15.395
whether they've actually arrived yet.

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:16.129
They may have.

00:03:16.129 --> 00:03:17.063
The police told me there's

00:03:17.063 --> 00:03:18.464
lots of people on the scene,

00:03:18.464 --> 00:03:19.966
which is a few hundred yards

00:03:19.966 --> 00:03:21.701
away from where we're allowed to go.

00:03:21.701 --> 00:03:23.403
The road's been blocked off.

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:24.537
But it is, as Kevin

00:03:24.537 --> 00:03:26.172
was saying in his last report,

00:03:26.172 --> 00:03:30.276
and it is so crucial for the poles

00:03:30.777 --> 00:03:32.011
the night our alliance,

00:03:32.011 --> 00:03:33.513
to get to the bottom

00:03:33.513 --> 00:03:35.515
of who actually fired this missile,

00:03:35.515 --> 00:03:36.749
because if it was the Russians

00:03:36.749 --> 00:03:37.584
and the Russians

00:03:37.584 --> 00:03:39.052
categorically deny it,

00:03:39.052 --> 00:03:41.354
that's one course of action.

00:03:41.354 --> 00:03:42.255
That's potentially

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:44.324
and potentially a very serious one,

00:03:44.324 --> 00:03:45.925
given the Article

00:03:45.925 --> 00:03:47.493
five of the NATO's treaty,

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:48.962
which means an attack on one

00:03:48.962 --> 00:03:49.862
alliance member

00:03:49.862 --> 00:03:51.764
is an attack on all of them.

00:03:51.764 --> 00:03:53.132
And if it's the Ukrainians,

00:03:53.132 --> 00:03:54.601
as is possible,

00:03:54.601 --> 00:03:55.501
that's a very different

00:03:55.501 --> 00:03:56.836
set of consequences.

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:59.672
I think you have to remember the context

00:03:59.806 --> 00:04:01.574
in which this missile strike

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:04.043
or this explosion actually took place.

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.311
It was at a time

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:07.280
when there were nearly 100

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:08.314
cruise missiles

00:04:08.314 --> 00:04:08.915
being fired

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.250
at various targets inside

00:04:10.250 --> 00:04:12.118
Ukraine by the Russians

00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:13.653
and the Ukrainians, Ukrainians

00:04:13.653 --> 00:04:15.955
desperately trying to intercept them

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:18.124
with their Russian made interceptors.

00:04:18.124 --> 00:04:18.858
So you can easily

00:04:18.858 --> 00:04:20.193
see how it could have been the Russians

00:04:20.193 --> 00:04:21.461
or the Ukrainians

00:04:21.461 --> 00:04:22.929
that are responsible for this.

00:04:22.929 --> 00:04:23.730
You certainly can.

00:04:23.730 --> 00:04:24.464
Matthew Chance, a

00:04:24.464 --> 00:04:25.865
thank you so much to you and your team

00:04:25.865 --> 00:04:27.800
there in that village, Don.

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:28.968
So let's get some analysis

00:04:28.968 --> 00:04:29.569
on all of this.

00:04:29.569 --> 00:04:30.837
Want to bring in now retired U.S.

00:04:30.837 --> 00:04:32.972
Army Major Mike Lyons.

00:04:32.972 --> 00:04:33.573
Good morning to you.

00:04:33.573 --> 00:04:35.408
Thank you so much for joining.

00:04:35.408 --> 00:04:37.043
Was a very simple question.

00:04:37.043 --> 00:04:37.877
Was it a mistake

00:04:37.877 --> 00:04:38.111
Yeah,

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:39.812
it looks like it's a terrible mistake

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.581
because of the Ukraine air

00:04:41.581 --> 00:04:42.482
defense platform.

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:44.317
So they're deployed in depth across

00:04:44.317 --> 00:04:45.685
Ukraine in such a way

00:04:45.685 --> 00:04:47.220
to protect the major cities

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:47.854
and infrastructure

00:04:47.854 --> 00:04:48.421
and what happened

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:49.422
is for the past

00:04:49.422 --> 00:04:50.923
24 hours, Russia has been firing

00:04:50.923 --> 00:04:52.625
hundreds of missiles in here.

00:04:52.625 --> 00:04:53.793
And as one gets close

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.094
to leave here, for example,

00:04:55.094 --> 00:04:56.029
one of these

00:04:56.029 --> 00:04:57.830
air defense systems is a chaser

00:04:57.830 --> 00:04:58.931
Hits it from behind,

00:04:58.931 --> 00:05:00.333
likely gets it close to the border

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:01.567
and then pushes that debris

00:05:01.567 --> 00:05:02.201
right over the border.

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:03.670
It's only four kilometers,

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:04.804
so it's not the target.

00:05:04.804 --> 00:05:06.673
Makes no sense from Russia's perspective.

00:05:06.673 --> 00:05:07.373
Again, you look at

00:05:07.373 --> 00:05:08.241
what happened on the ground.

00:05:08.241 --> 00:05:10.376
It looks like it was remnants from air

00:05:10.376 --> 00:05:11.511
defense systems

00:05:11.511 --> 00:05:13.112
having been there in Lviv.

00:05:13.112 --> 00:05:13.946
I mean, this is pretty close

00:05:13.946 --> 00:05:14.714
to the Polish border

00:05:14.714 --> 00:05:16.516
as a way that most people come into

00:05:16.516 --> 00:05:17.050
the country.

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.084
Now, because it usually

00:05:18.084 --> 00:05:18.851
they would go into

00:05:18.851 --> 00:05:19.852
possibly going to Russia.

00:05:19.852 --> 00:05:21.721
But now this is really far west

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:22.422
for this to happen.

00:05:22.422 --> 00:05:24.123
Rockets are going this far

00:05:24.123 --> 00:05:25.425
into Ukraine now. Yeah.

00:05:25.425 --> 00:05:27.126
And a lot of it has to do with the fact

00:05:27.126 --> 00:05:29.228
that Russian troops

00:05:29.228 --> 00:05:29.562
yeah,

00:05:29.562 --> 00:05:30.797
Russian troops have deployed

00:05:30.797 --> 00:05:31.531
in this area

00:05:31.531 --> 00:05:32.432
here to save them

00:05:32.432 --> 00:05:33.800
from a tactical perspective.

00:05:33.800 --> 00:05:34.634
So strategically,

00:05:34.634 --> 00:05:35.568
now you're going to see long

00:05:35.568 --> 00:05:36.202
range bombing,

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:37.737
long range missile attacks into the West,

00:05:37.737 --> 00:05:38.338
knowing that's

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:40.106
where the supply lines are.

00:05:40.106 --> 00:05:42.442
Infrastructure is that the Ukraine

00:05:42.442 --> 00:05:44.510
is looking to have a very tough winter.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:45.144
Russia is going to try

00:05:45.144 --> 00:05:46.412
to turn the lights on

00:05:46.412 --> 00:05:47.814
to analyze out of Ukraine

00:05:47.814 --> 00:05:49.382
and give them as much hardship

00:05:49.382 --> 00:05:49.982
as they can,

00:05:49.982 --> 00:05:51.417
really terrorist type attacks here.

00:05:51.417 --> 00:05:53.653
So then the next question is now what?

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:54.287
Now what happens?

00:05:54.287 --> 00:05:55.922
Because Russia will obviously use this

00:05:55.922 --> 00:05:57.223
for propaganda Right.

00:05:57.223 --> 00:05:58.157
So so Naito

00:05:58.157 --> 00:05:58.725
looks like they're going

00:05:58.725 --> 00:05:59.859
to have an article for which

00:05:59.859 --> 00:06:01.260
we'll have a meeting to discuss it,

00:06:01.260 --> 00:06:01.961
not Article five.

00:06:01.961 --> 00:06:03.296
Article five would be an escalation.

00:06:03.296 --> 00:06:04.364
We want to do that.

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:05.331
I think NATO's going to come up

00:06:05.331 --> 00:06:06.766
with a better political solution.

00:06:06.766 --> 00:06:08.835
Here, possibly give Ukraine

00:06:08.835 --> 00:06:09.635
more weapons,

00:06:09.635 --> 00:06:10.203
knowing full

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:11.371
well that they're going to need help

00:06:11.371 --> 00:06:12.105
in this wintertime

00:06:12.105 --> 00:06:14.440
as Russia has dug in at this point, maybe

00:06:14.941 --> 00:06:16.909
longer range attack missiles themselves

00:06:16.909 --> 00:06:17.510
the problem is

00:06:17.510 --> 00:06:18.811
we haven't given them in the past

00:06:18.811 --> 00:06:20.179
because we don't want those missiles

00:06:20.179 --> 00:06:21.447
to be fired inside of Russia.

00:06:21.447 --> 00:06:21.948
We want to give them

00:06:21.948 --> 00:06:22.782
that kind of capacity.

00:06:22.782 --> 00:06:23.916
So Article four is basically

00:06:23.916 --> 00:06:25.051
to meet and discuss this.

00:06:25.051 --> 00:06:26.252
Article five is actually

00:06:26.252 --> 00:06:27.153
when there is some action

00:06:27.153 --> 00:06:28.621
taken in Article five, right.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:30.256
The NATO's members would decide

00:06:30.256 --> 00:06:31.891
what to do. It still doesn't trigger war.

00:06:31.891 --> 00:06:32.225
It doesn't

00:06:32.225 --> 00:06:33.059
necessarily mean

00:06:33.059 --> 00:06:35.261
it's not an automatic world war three.

00:06:35.261 --> 00:06:36.929
It means some countries of response.

00:06:36.929 --> 00:06:37.864
Article five has been triggered

00:06:37.864 --> 00:06:38.431
only once.

00:06:38.431 --> 00:06:40.400
September 12th, 2001,

00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:41.601
the day after nine 11

00:06:41.601 --> 00:06:43.703
when the countries got together decided.

00:06:43.703 --> 00:06:44.337
And what they did

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:46.439
was they put an air force squadron

00:06:46.439 --> 00:06:47.607
together in order to respond.

00:06:47.607 --> 00:06:48.241
That was it.

00:06:48.241 --> 00:06:49.275
So as we look at

00:06:49.275 --> 00:06:50.676
this, is the new information,

00:06:50.676 --> 00:06:52.278
what Article four is and what happens.

00:06:52.278 --> 00:06:53.312
But again, that is

00:06:53.312 --> 00:06:54.647
there's no official

00:06:54.647 --> 00:06:55.848
calling for Article four.

00:06:55.848 --> 00:06:56.149
They're just

00:06:56.149 --> 00:06:57.483
looking into the possibility.

00:06:57.483 --> 00:06:59.285
And that's just a meeting

00:06:59.285 --> 00:07:00.286
to discuss, right.

00:07:00.286 --> 00:07:01.053
Article for the meeting.

00:07:01.053 --> 00:07:01.921
And it'll be political pressure

00:07:01.921 --> 00:07:03.055
on Poland not to go.

00:07:03.055 --> 00:07:03.623
Article five.

00:07:03.623 --> 00:07:05.124
So then what happens in Zelinski now?

00:07:05.124 --> 00:07:06.726
How does what is

00:07:06.726 --> 00:07:08.327
how is he going to respond to this?

00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:09.662
Well, I mean, he's going to continue

00:07:09.662 --> 00:07:10.797
to have strong rhetoric

00:07:10.797 --> 00:07:11.898
with regard to this war.

00:07:11.898 --> 00:07:12.932
He wants more support

00:07:12.932 --> 00:07:14.133
from the West that keeps coming.

00:07:14.133 --> 00:07:15.401
And Western countries

00:07:15.401 --> 00:07:16.068
have got to again

00:07:16.068 --> 00:07:18.037
decide maybe this meeting will determine

00:07:18.037 --> 00:07:19.906
and within Article four will determine

00:07:19.906 --> 00:07:21.307
that he will get more support.

00:07:21.307 --> 00:07:23.042
He still needs to figure out a way

00:07:23.042 --> 00:07:23.476
how he's going

00:07:23.476 --> 00:07:24.310
to get through this winter.

00:07:24.310 --> 00:07:25.311
That's the kind of helping he's

00:07:25.311 --> 00:07:26.612
going to say, even though it was

00:07:26.612 --> 00:07:27.146
you know,

00:07:27.513 --> 00:07:29.248
it was a sad consequence of the war

00:07:29.248 --> 00:07:29.615
and therefore,

00:07:29.615 --> 00:07:31.217
